GGUF VAE Loader节点，然后分别加载Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF 及pig_qwen_image_vae_fp32-f16 模型，可以进一步降低显存要求，理论上12g显存机器能正常使用。（runninghub上暂时没有这两个clip及vae模型，因此上述节点指引建议在本地部署时设置）\n\n注：由于使用了量化的gguf因此对部分对象生成的效果会不太理想，可以选择抽卡或修改提示词解决，若还是不行换非量化的模型解决问题。\n\n模型地址\n1、qwen-rapid-nsfw-v7.1-Q4_K_M\nhttps://huggingface.co/Phil2Sat/Qwen-Image-Edit-Rapid-AIO-GGUF/tree/main/v71\n\n2、Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF \nhttps://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF/tree/main\n\n3、pig_qwen_image_vae_fp32-f16\nhttps://huggingface.co/calcuis/pig-vae/tree/main"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [490.61358642578125, 339.276611328125], "pos": [-2001.8946533203125, -850.8685913085938], "id": 137, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "workspace_info": {"id": "-CoZwL5qTs7jNvhC-p_wu"}, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.28.8", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": [2779.6542250859734, 1066.5011164948978], "scale": 1.283902517749502}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "模型加载", "bounding": [-1472.6575927734375, -889.1138916015625, 482.83489990234375, 1025.65478515625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "图片输入", "bounding": [-1471.4246826171875, 151.22714233398438, 1582.7113037109375, 747.3800048828125]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "最终图像", "bounding": [127.04278564453125, 157.4781494140625, 1302.7041015625, 747.1519165039062]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Group", "bounding": [-975.6121826171875, -884.3390502929688, 2405.114501953125, 1024.4088134765625]}], "links": [[171, 64, 0, 65, 0, "MODEL"], [175, 65, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [177, 67, 0, 64, 0, "MODEL"], [220, 41, 0, 86, 0, "IMAGE"], [228, 91, 0, 65, 2, 